<view class="page messages-page"><view class="messages-head"><view><text class="eyebrow">LETTERS BETWEEN US</text><text class="display-title">信笺</text></view><button class="text-button" bindtap="readAll">全部已读</button></view><text class="section-note">新共享时刻、回应、短评和安全通知会留在这里。</text><view class="message-list"><button wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="id" class="message-item {{!item.read ? 'unread' : ''}} press" data-id="{{item.momentId}}" bindtap="open"><view class="message-mark">{{item.type === 'REACTION' ? '♥' : item.type === 'PET' ? '☁' : item.type === 'COMMENT' ? '“' : '⌁'}}</view><view class="message-copy"><view><text>{{item.title}}</text><text class="time">{{item.createdAt}}</text></view><text class="label">{{item.summary}}</text></view><view class="decor" wx:if="{{!item.read}}"></view></button></view></view>
